      "As the antigen screening route gradually became clear, a new question emerged: epitope evaluation for a multi-epitope vaccine needs to be performed under a defined HLA background, and the population distribution of HLA varies significantly. Which HLA type should we choose as the basis for epitope screening?—The arrows in the tree diagram thus pointed simultaneously to Professor Wu Di (HLA restriction) and to a follow-up visit with Professor Hu Jifan (ADC target reuse and confirmation of the multi-antigen strategy)."
